      <name>Intelligence Summary</name>
      <Placemark>
        <name>AI Council Assessment</name>
        <styleUrl>#intel</styleUrl>
        <description>The U.S. Navy conducted a successful trial of a robotic towed connector for capturing, refueling, and releasing unmanned surface vessels (USV). This trial is part of the Navy&#39;s efforts to develop technologies that support persistent unmanned operations at sea, aligning with modern naval strategy.</description>
